If you're wondering&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:03.280 --> 00:05:08.800
what on earth he's talking about, did you miss&nbsp;
something? We were all wondering that yesterday.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:09.440 --> 00:05:14.960
It made no sense whatsoever. I had no idea&nbsp;
what this guy was talking about. And indeed,&nbsp;&nbsp;

